{"path":"/tip/13-02","title":"老人摔倒、有人倒地，先蹲下喊他、打 120，别急着把人扶起来；陌生人这档走开在国内也合法，停下来就别上手搬 | HowToLiveBetter","description":"这条的主线是自家老人和身边熟人。先看有没有呼吸，没有就按第 1 条（用力按压胸口）压胸。有呼吸也别抱起来：人可能是先中风、先晕厥才摔的，硬扶会加重。蹲下叫他，问他记不记得自己怎么倒的。腰背疼、像骨折的一律不搬，原地打 120。","lang":"zh","styles":["/sites/howtolivebetter/styles/bca54bebe9c1bd3b.css"],"bodyClass":"font-sans antialiased","nodes":[{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-site"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-header-slot","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[]},{"tag":"header","props":{"className":"life-header"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-header-inner"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-brand","aria-label":"H ✳ HowToLiveBetter 首页","href":"/"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-brand-mark","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":["H",{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["✳"]}]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["HowToLive",{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["Better"]}]}]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-nav","aria-label":"主导航"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-nav-link","href":"/book"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["阅读全书"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-nav-link","href":"/top-50"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["精选 50 条"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-nav-link","href":"/daily"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["每日任务"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-nav-link","href":"/dashboard"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["我的清单"]}]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-nav-link life-nav-more","aria-haspopup":"menu","aria-expanded":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["更多"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"15","height":"15","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-chevron-down","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m6 9 6 6 6-6"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-header-tools"},"children":[{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-sound-toggle","aria-label":"关闭音效","aria-pressed":"true","title":"关闭音效"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-volume2 lucide-volume-2","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M11 4.702a.705.705 0 0 0-1.203-.498L6.413 7.587A1.4 1.4 0 0 1 5.416 8H3a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v6a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h2.416a1.4 1.4 0 0 1 .997.413l3.383 3.384A.705.705 0 0 0 11 19.298z"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M16 9a5 5 0 0 1 0 6"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M19.364 18.364a9 9 0 0 0 0-12.728"},"children":[]}]}]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-theme-trigger","aria-label":"跟随系统","aria-haspopup":"menu","aria-expanded":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"17","height":"17","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-sun life-theme-icon-light","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"12","cy":"12","r":"4"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M12 2v2"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M12 20v2"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m4.93 4.93 1.41 1.41"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m17.66 17.66 1.41 1.41"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M2 12h2"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M20 12h2"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m6.34 17.66-1.41 1.41"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m19.07 4.93-1.41 1.41"},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"17","height":"17","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-moon life-theme-icon-dark","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M12 3a6 6 0 0 0 9 9 9 9 0 1 1-9-9Z"},"children":[]}]}]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-language-switch","aria-label":"中文 选择语言","aria-haspopup":"menu","aria-expanded":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-globe","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"12","cy":"12","r":"10"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M12 2a14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0 20 14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0-20"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M2 12h20"},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["中文"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-chevron-down","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m6 9 6 6 6-6"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-account","href":"/sign-in"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"17","height":"17","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-circle-user-round","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M18 20a6 6 0 0 0-12 0"},"children":[]},{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"12","cy":"10","r":"4"},"children":[]},{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"12","cy":"12","r":"10"},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["登录同步"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"main","props":{"className":"life-reader life-tip-layout"},"children":[{"tag":"aside","props":{"className":"life-reader-sidebar life-tip-sidebar"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-back-link","href":"/book/13"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-left","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 19-7-7 7-7"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M19 12H5"},"children":[]}]},"返回目录"]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-sidebar-caption"},"children":["紧急情况：先做什么"]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"aria-label":"章节条目"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/13-01","className":""},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["01"]},"有人倒地没呼吸，立刻用力按压胸口，让旁人打 120 并找 AED"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/13-02","className":"active"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["02"]},"老人摔倒、有人倒地，先蹲下喊他、打 120，别急着把人扶起来；陌生人这档走开在国内也合法，停下来就别上手搬"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/13-03","className":""},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["03"]},"突然嘴歪、一侧胳膊没劲、说话说不清，立刻打 120，不要等、不要自己开车去"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/13-04","className":""},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["04"]},"突然天旋地转站不稳、看东西成双、一只眼发黑，或者手指点不到自己鼻尖，也按卒中打 120"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/13-05","className":""},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["05"]},"一只眼睛突然像拉下窗帘一样黑掉，哪怕几分钟就自己好了，也当天按卒中去急诊"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/13-06","className":""},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["06"]},"一只眼又胀又痛、发红，看灯有一圈彩虹，还头痛恶心想吐，当天去眼科急诊"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/13-07","className":""},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["07"]},"胸口压着疼、闷、发紧超过 15 分钟不缓解，打 120，不要自己扛也不要自己开车"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/13-08","className":""},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["08"]},"突然像被撕开一样的剧痛，从胸口往后背、往腰一路挪，打 120 并说清「疼在移动」"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/13-09","className":""},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["09"]},"突然一记「这辈子最疼的头痛」，一小时内就到最疼，立刻去急诊做头颅 CT"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/13-10","className":""},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["10"]},"老人磕过头之后两三周到几个月变得走路不稳、迟钝、嗜睡或者一侧没劲，去做头颅 CT"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/13-11","className":""},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["11"]},"一条腿突然肿起来、发紧、按着疼，尽快就医；再加上突然喘不上气或者胸痛，立刻打 120"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/13-12","className":""},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["12"]},"大出血先用手死死压住伤口，四肢压不住就上止血带，同时打 120"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/13-13","className":""},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["13"]},"被狗、猫咬伤或抓破皮，先用肥皂水和流水交替冲 15 分钟，当天去打疫苗"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/13-14","className":""},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["14"]},"烫伤后立刻用凉的流动水冲 20 分钟，别抹牙膏酱油"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/13-15","className":""},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["15"]},"突然全身起疹、喘不上气或者发晕，按过敏性休克处理，立刻叫 120 并说清楚"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/13-16","className":""},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["16"]},"有人抽搐倒地，清开周围、让他侧躺、看表计时，什么都别往嘴里塞"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/13-17","className":""},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["17"]},"糖尿病人突然发抖、出冷汗、说话不清，先给 15 克糖，15 分钟后复测"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/13-18","className":""},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["18"]},"有人触电，先断电，再用干燥的木棍之类挑开电源，不要直接上手拉"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/13-19","className":""},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["19"]},"一氧化碳报警器响了，或者一屋子人同时头痛恶心，先出门再打电话"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/13-20","className":""},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["20"]},"误服清洁剂、农药、药物先别催吐，带上瓶子立刻就医；溅到眼睛或皮肤用大量清水至少冲 15 分钟"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/13-21","className":""},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["21"]},"酸碱等化学品溅到身上，立刻脱掉污染的衣服、用大量流动清水冲，眼睛要掰开眼皮冲，冲够时间再走"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/13-22","className":""},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["22"]},"高温下头晕、恶心、不出汗或意识不清，立刻挪到阴凉处脱衣泼水降温，意识不清的不喂水、打 120"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/13-23","className":""},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["23"]},"中暑的人只要清醒，就少量多次喝凉的淡盐水或运动饮料，别猛灌、别喝酒和高糖饮料"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/13-24","className":""},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["24"]},"火灾时贴地爬、摸门再开门、门烫就别开，走楼梯不坐电梯，出去了别回头"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/13-25","className":""},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["25"]},"看到有人溺水，先叫人和打 110/120，伸竿、抛漂浮物，自己不下水"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/13-26","className":""},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["26"]},"有人噎住说不出话，1 岁以上的站到背后做 5 次拍背加 5 次腹部冲击，倒下就做心肺复苏"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/13-27","className":""},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["27"]},"在戈壁、沙漠、无人区迷路或车坏了，留在原地或车旁，先报位置，再遮阳保温，省水，不乱走"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/13-28","className":""},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["28"]},"发抖、说话含糊、走路打晃是失温，换掉湿衣、包起来，先暖躯干，喝热甜饮不喝酒"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/13-29","className":""},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["29"]},"被蛇咬，坐下别动、摘掉戒指手表、尽快送医院打抗蛇毒血清，不切、不吸、不绑死"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/13-30","className":""},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["30"]},"地震时先看自己在什么房子里：符合抗震设防的楼里就地躲，会垮的老房子门在几步外就出去"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/13-31","className":""},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["31"]},"遇到熊、野猪、成群野狗，别跑，侧身慢慢退开"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/13-32","className":""},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["32"]},"野外遇上雷雨，钻进有硬顶的车或建筑，避开山脊、孤树、水面和金属"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/13-33","className":""},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["33"]},"上高原按睡眠海拔（当晚睡在多高）慢慢升，症状加重就下撤，不要硬扛"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/13-34","className":""},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["34"]},"被蜱虫叮住，用尖头镊子贴着皮肤稳稳拉出来，别涂油别用火烧"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/13-35","className":""},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["35"]},"野外的水一律烧开再喝，滚开一分钟就够，不用因为海拔高多煮"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/13-36","className":""},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["36"]},"荒郊野外被陌生人索财，钱给他，不动手，记特征，脱身后报警"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/13-37","className":""},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["37"]},"撞见一群人打架，退开走人，别上去拉架、别围观、别捡地上的家伙；要报警就退到安全距离打 110"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/13-38","className":""},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["38"]},"可能被 HIV 暴露了，72 小时内去拿阻断药，越早越好"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/13-39","className":""},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["39"]},"救人受了伤、搭进了钱，先找加害人和医保，再去申报见义勇为确认"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/13-40","className":""},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["40"]},"刀、钢筋、玻璃扎进身体，压住异物周围止血，不要把它拔出来"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/13-41","className":""},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["41"]},"怀疑骨折就别再动那个部位，托着不动、冷敷 20 分钟以内，别自己掰正"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/13-42","className":""},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["42"]},"被性侵之后，先到安全的地方打 110；验伤之前别洗澡、别洗衣服、别收拾房间，72 小时内去医院"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/13-43","className":""},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["43"]},"不满 1 岁的婴儿噎住哭不出声，趴着拍背 5 下、翻过来按胸口 5 下，轮着做，别按肚子"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/13-44","className":""},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["44"]},"不满 1 岁的婴儿没反应、没正常呼吸，开免提打 120，做婴儿心肺复苏：按 30 下吹 2 口气"]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-tip-page","data-tip-locales":"zh,en,ru,es,ja,vi"},"children":[{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tip-breadcrumb","aria-label":"当前位置"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/book"},"children":["阅读全书"]},{"tag":"span","props":{"aria-hidden":"true"},"children":["/"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/book/13"},"children":["第 13 章 · 紧急情况：先做什么"]}]},{"tag":"article","props":{"className":"life-entry-card status-unmarked is-standalone","id":"13-02"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-top"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-entry-number"},"children":["02"]},{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-evidence grade-b"},"children":["证据 B"]}]},{"tag":"h1","props":{"lang":"zh"},"children":["老人摔倒、有人倒地，先蹲下喊他、打 120，别急着把人扶起来；陌生人这档走开在国内也合法，停下来就别上手搬"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"lang":"zh","className":"life-entry-summary"},"children":["这条的主线是自家老人和身边熟人。先看有没有呼吸，没有就按第 1 条（用力按压胸口）压胸。有呼吸也别抱起来：人可能是先中风、先晕厥才摔的，硬扶会加重。蹲下叫他，问他记不记得自己怎么倒的。腰背疼、像骨折的一律不搬，原地打 120。"]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-impact"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["成本"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["不花钱。蹲下去问一句、打个电话，几分钟。难的是忍住伸手去扶的那一下。对陌生人还要多算一笔：打 120 会留下你的号码，可能被回电，也可能被问一次话。真被家属盯上，打官司是几个月起步的事。而且就算最后判你赢，律师费也得自己出。"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["收益"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["卫生部《老年人跌倒干预技术指南》写明两句话。一句是「跌倒是我国 65 岁以上老年人伤害死亡的首位原因」。另一句是「发现老年人跌倒，不要急于扶起，要分情况进行处理」。意识不清的，立即拨打急救电话。有呕吐的，把头偏向一侧并清理口鼻。呼吸心跳停止的，立即做胸外按压。「如需搬动，应保证平稳，尽量平卧」。意识…"]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-actions","aria-label":"标记：老人摔倒、有人倒地，先蹲下喊他、打 120，别急着把人扶起来；陌生人这档走开在国内也合法，停下来就别上手搬"},"children":[{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action done","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-check","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M20 6 9 17l-5-5"},"children":[]}]},"已做到"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action todo","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-list-todo","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"rect","props":{"x":"3","y":"5","width":"6","height":"6","rx":"1"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m3 17 2 2 4-4"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 6h8"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 12h8"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 18h8"},"children":[]}]},"加入待做"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action favorite","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-bookmark","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m19 21-7-4-7 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h10a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v16z"},"children":[]}]},"收藏"]}," ",{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"social-share-trigger"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-share2 lucide-share-2","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"18","cy":"5","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"6","cy":"12","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"18","cy":"19","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"line","props":{"x1":"8.59","x2":"15.42","y1":"13.51","y2":"17.49"},"children":[]},{"tag":"line","props":{"x1":"15.41","x2":"8.59","y1":"6.51","y2":"10.49"},"children":[]}]},"分享这条建议"]}]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-detail-toggle","aria-expanded":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"10","height":"10","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"currentColor","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-circle","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"12","cy":"12","r":"10"},"children":[]}]},"收起详情"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-chevron-down rotated","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m6 9 6 6 6-6"},"children":[]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-details"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["成本"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["不花钱。蹲下去问一句、打个电话，几分钟。难的是忍住伸手去扶的那一下。对陌生人还要多算一笔：打 120 会留下你的号码，可能被回电，也可能被问一次话。真被家属盯上，打官司是几个月起步的事。而且就算最后判你赢，律师费也得自己出。"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["收益"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["卫生部《老年人跌倒干预技术指南》写明两句话。一句是「跌倒是我国 65 岁以上老年人伤害死亡的首位原因」。另一句是「发现老年人跌倒，不要急于扶起，要分情况进行处理」。意识不清的，立即拨打急救电话。有呕吐的，把头偏向一侧并清理口鼻。呼吸心跳停止的，立即做胸外按压。「如需搬动，应保证平稳，尽量平卧」。意识清楚的，先问他对跌倒过程有没有记忆，「如不能记起，可能为晕厥或脑血管意外」。有剧烈头痛，或者口角歪斜、言语不利、手脚无力的，「立即扶起老年人可能加重脑出血或脑缺血，使病情加重」。有骨折迹象，或者腰背疼痛、大小便失禁的，「如无相关专业知识，不要随便搬动」。以上几种都应立即拨打急救电话。老人自己想站起来的，可以协助他缓慢起立，「坐、卧休息并观察，确认无碍后方可离开」。说到「怕被讹」，法律上是这样规定的。《最高人民法院关于适用〈中华人民共和国民事诉讼法〉的解释》第九十条有两句。头一句是「当事人对自己提出的诉讼请求所依据的事实……应当提供证据加以证明」。第二句是「在作出判决前，当事人未能提供证据或者证据不足以证明其事实主张的，由负有举证证明责任的当事人承担不利的后果」。民法典第一千一百九十八条的原文是：「宾馆、商场、银行、车站、机场、体育场馆、娱乐场所等经营场所、公共场所的经营者、管理者或者群众性活动的组织者，未尽到安全保障义务，造成他人损害的，应当承担侵权责任。」民法典第一百八十四条：「因自愿实施紧急救助行为造成受助人损害的，救助人不承担民事责任」。最高人民法院公布过一个典型案例。药店经营者给心脏骤停的人做心肺复苏，压断了对方的肋骨。受助人住院 18 天，索赔 9 千余元。法院判决救助人不承担民事责任"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["来源"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["卫生部 (2011). 老年人跌倒干预技术指南（「老年人跌倒后的处理」）. 全文 PDF 见广东省疾病预防控制中心 ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"http://cdcp.gd.gov.cn/gcdcdfiles/editor/uploadfile/20111027094832117.pdf","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["http://cdcp.gd.gov.cn/gcdcdfiles/editor/uploadfile/20111027094832117.pdf"]},"，现场处理部分全文见贵南县人民政府转载 ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.guinan.gov.cn/lnb/zc1__zwgk/zc/aztfl/qt/content_27609778","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.guinan.gov.cn/lnb/zc1__zwgk/zc/aztfl/qt/content_27609778"]},"；全国人大 (2020). 民法典（第一百八十三、一百八十四条）. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.spp.gov.cn/spp/fl/202006/t20200602_463888.shtml","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.spp.gov.cn/spp/fl/202006/t20200602_463888.shtml"]},"；最高人民法院 (2023). 人民法院抓实公正与效率践行社会主义核心价值观典型案例（案例十三，齐某某诉孙某某健康权纠纷案，辽宁省康平县人民法院）. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.court.gov.cn/zixun/xiangqing/408162.html","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.court.gov.cn/zixun/xiangqing/408162.html"]},"；最高人民法院 (2022 年第二次修正，2022 年 4 月 10 日施行). 关于适用《中华人民共和国民事诉讼法》的解释（第九十条）. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.court.gov.cn/zixun/xiangqing/353651.html","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.court.gov.cn/zixun/xiangqing/353651.html"]},"；民法典第一千一百九十八条同上最高检转载全文；全国人大常委会 (2023 年修正，2024 年 1 月 1 日施行). 民事诉讼法（第一百五十二、一百六十四条）. 上海市发展和改革委员会转载全文 ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://fgw.sh.gov.cn/ys-syjf-zc-2.4.1-h5/20240408/073febdb2b04464390546232d4089f51.html","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://fgw.sh.gov.cn/ys-syjf-zc-2.4.1-h5/20240408/073febdb2b04464390546232d4089f51.html"]},"；国务院 (2006). 诉讼费用交纳办法（国务院令第 481 号，第六、二十九条）. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.gov.cn/ziliao/flfg/2006-12/29/content_483682.htm","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.gov.cn/ziliao/flfg/2006-12/29/content_483682.htm"]},"；全国人大常委会 (2025). 治安管理处罚法（2025 年修订，2026 年 1 月 1 日起施行，第二十六条第一项、第五十条第五项）. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.spp.gov.cn/spp/fl/202506/t20250627_699863.shtml","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.spp.gov.cn/spp/fl/202506/t20250627_699863.shtml"]},"；德国联邦司法部. Strafgesetzbuch (StGB) § 323c Unterlassene Hilfeleistung; Behinderung von hilfeleistenden Personen. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.gesetze-im-internet.de/stgb/__323c.html","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.gesetze-im-internet.de/stgb/__323c.html"]},""]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["原书备注"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["定 B 是因为指南只说了该怎么处置，没有「照做能少死多少人」的数字。第一百八十四条免的是救人过程中弄出的损害，前提是你自愿、情况紧急。「自作主张把人塞进私家车送医」这类它不管，等 120 更稳妥。打完 120 别挂电话，按接线的调度员说的做。这套判断首先是给自家老人和熟人用的。换成路上不认识的人，走开不违法，也最省事：中国法律没规定你必须救。出了国就不一定了。比如在德国，碰上事故或险情，帮得上、又不会让自己陷进大危险却不帮，本身就是犯罪，最高判 1 年或者罚款。人在国外，按当地法律算。停下来要付的账要逐层算：时间、留号码、被家属找上、被告上法庭、闹到单位、被拍被传上网。详见 [docs/遇到陌生人出事该不该停.md](../docs/遇到陌生人出事该不该停.md)。真决定停下，唯一必须做到的是**别上手搬**，理由在医学上：硬扶可能加重脑出血或者脊柱损伤。有一个例外：这地方要是你在经营、你在管，或者活动是你组织的，走开就可能要担责。民法典第一千一百九十八条给的安全保障义务，要求你为场子里的人负一份安全责任。防跌倒本身见第 1 节第 13 条（练平衡和腿部力量）。老人磕过头之后的迟发症状见本节第 10 条。救人受伤之后的钱见本节第 39 条。被网暴怎么留证报警见第 8 节第 16 条。"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-personal-note"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["我的备注"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button"},"children":["写下对自己有用的提醒…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link","href":"/tip/13-01"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-left","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 19-7-7 7-7"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M19 12H5"},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["上一条"]},"有人倒地没呼吸，立刻用力按压胸口，让旁人打 120 并找 AED"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link next","href":"/tip/13-03"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["下一条"]},"突然嘴歪、一侧胳膊没劲、说话说不清，立刻打 120，不要等、不要自己开车去"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M5 12h14"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 5 7 7-7 7"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"tag":"section","props":{"className":"life-tip-related"},"children":[{"tag":"h2","props":{},"children":["本主题的其他建议"]},{"tag":"ul","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/13-04"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["突然天旋地转站不稳、看东西成双、一只眼发黑，或者手指点不到自己鼻尖，也按卒中打 120"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["只看「脸歪、抬手、说话」三条，一成多的卒中会被漏掉，因为有的卒中一开始既不歪嘴也不瘫手。把站不稳、看东西重影或缺一块也算进去，漏掉的降到 4.4%。突然天旋地转…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/13-05"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["一只眼睛突然像拉下窗帘一样黑掉，哪怕几分钟就自己好了，也当天按卒中去急诊"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["一只眼突然像拉下窗帘一样黑掉，是眼底血管堵了，堵得越久，能救回的视网膜越少。它也是脑缺血的一种，接下来几天容易中风。当天评估、当天开始治的人，90 天内再中风的…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/13-06"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["一只眼又胀又痛、发红，看灯有一圈彩虹，还头痛恶心想吐，当天去眼科急诊"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["这是青光眼急性发作。眼睛里的水排不出去，眼压一下子顶上去。拖得越久，视神经压坏得越多，坏了就回不来。武汉封控期间的病人平均拖了 241 小时才治上，失明的占 2…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"